---
import BaseLayout from "../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../data/site";

---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="关于 Blooming Logs 和这个站点的主人。">
  <section class="section-shell split-grid">
    <div class="intro-slab">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">Who lives here?</span>
        <h1 class="headline">A person building a tiny house for notes.</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">
        Blooming Logs 想做成一个不像“模板博客”的个人空间。它会收纳文章、代码、音乐、图像、慢观察，也会保留一点奇怪但温柔的秩序。
      </p>
      <p class="lede">
        现在这页先提供清晰的自我介绍位置，后面你可以继续替换成更具体的照片、自画像插图和外链。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="detail-list">
      <div class="detail-item">
        <div class="detail-kicker">Site name</div>
        <strong>{siteConfig.name}</strong>
        <p class="note-line">{siteConfig.tagline}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-item">
        <div class="detail-kicker">What goes here</div>
        <strong>Notes, Lab, Records, Frames, Garden, Archive</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="detail-item">
        <div class="detail-kicker">Contact</div>
        <p class="note-line">GitHub: {siteConfig.social.github}</p>
        <p class="note-line">Email: {siteConfig.email}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
